From deb2f142b23b401f2dd3175da4c1fe9c81d55de6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mkinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 21:28:13 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] fix(ui): stand the work envelope on the table plane

Translate the displayed box Z bounds to start at zero.
Keep its travel height and its X/Y reference.
Pin library machines, a shifted origin, and an inverted Z axis.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #1963
